    description: "## Retroactive creation — original ops lost to auto-pr clobber\n\nThis item was originally created during the 2026-05-26 session as WI-dilab-hitub-fudif-vavit-zutir-rojak-fimiv-vopah. Its ops file was lost when auto-pr's cleanup_local did git checkout dev + git pull, which overwrote the working-tree ops. The original tracker add, update to in_progress, and update to done all succeeded (confirmed via transcript), but the ops file never reached the auto-sync threshold (80 lines) before the session ended.\n\n## What shipped (PR #3921, commit 955ec5df7e)\n\nPass.depends_on migrated from list[str] to list[list[str]] (CNF: outer-AND of inner-OR clauses). All 57 linkers audited and populated. Validator split into validate_pass_name_resolution (static, CI-time) and validate_pass_dependencies (runtime CNF gating, not yet wired into run_behavior_map). TestINVHujogClosureCriterion property test pins the closure criterion. 12063 tests passed, 100% coverage on 50 changed source files."  # bc8b
